{"version":"https://jsonfeed.org/version/1.1","title":"异治法 - 标签","description":"Hugo FixIt 作者，喜欢瞎折腾、造轮子、写东西，分享一些前端开发中的所见、所闻、所思。","home_page_url":"https://lruihao.cn/","language":"zh-CN","icon":"https://lruihao.cn/apple-touch-icon.png","favicon":"https://lruihao.cn/favicon.ico","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://acuherb.xyz/images/avatar.png"}],"items":[{"title":"异治法：论中湿 论中暑 论中寒","date_published":"2026-05-22T16:48:52&#43;08:00","date_modified":"2026-05-22T16:51:52&#43;08:00","id":"https://lruihao.cn/posts/3-29-yizhifa/","url":"https://lruihao.cn/posts/3-29-yizhifa/","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://gravatar.loli.net/avatar/89719985bb81a6f9d508808413f1b999?s=32&amp;d=mp"}],"tags":["异治法","中湿","中暑","中寒"],"summary":"本节为《石室秘录》“异治法”部分，专论同一病症采用不同治法而皆能取效的原理。核心思想是：病同而治异，治法虽殊，理归一致。关键在于把握病机根本，因势利导，殊途同归。","content_html":"本节为《石室秘录》“异治法”部分，专论\u003cstrong\u003e同一病症采用不同治法而皆能取效\u003c/strong\u003e的原理。核心思想是：\u003cstrong\u003e病同而治异，治法虽殊，理归一致。关键在于把握病机根本，因势利导，殊途同归\u003c/strong\u003e。"}]}